Z||000000||CUTTER||01-27-2000||10:42 PM||||I just wrecked my car last week driving in the snow. I smashed the front facia and need a new one for my 87GT. I was woundering if anyone knew of any differnt "kit" like front facia I could get to replace my smashed one?<BR>you know....like one that looks like a ferrari front end or something differnt...<BR>Thanks, shane||||reg||1
Z||000001||WKDFIRO||01-28-2000||01:43 AM||||There is a member of Fieros of San Diego that has but a fiberglass replica of a 355 nose on his 87GT. It blew us all away when he pulled up. Even still in primer it looked good. He also had a very agressive rear spoiler to finish the look (like 88 Fiero's See Tom's Webpage.) But he was telling us that when he got the fiberglass nose thats ALL he got just the fiberglass nose. No brackets, no holes for bolts, nothing. Parts of it still had to be shaved off to fit the Fiero. Its a real labor of love. <P>Remember though, its fiberglass, it means that if you thought that your enduraflex nose looked bad, 1/4 of that impact would destroy this nose. Be Careful!||||reg||4
Z||000002||87FieroGT||01-28-2000||01:45 AM||||Pisa Corp has a front fascia that looks kind of like a ferrari 355 front end, but if I remember right the price was kinda steep. You can find there website at <BR> <A HREF="http://www.cybercars.com/fierohq.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cybercars.com/fierohq.html</A> <P>The bumper is called the Euro Bumper. Good luck on finding what you are looking for.||||reg||10
Z||000003||mwbackus||01-28-2000||02:36 AM||||Joe Niderost also offers a replacement nose that appears close to that of the 355.  I heard rumor that PISA's came from the same company before they sold the molds.  The rumor also stated that Joe had the secound generation of the mold, and that it was slightly superior to that of PISA's.  Just rumor, so dont quote me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Here is a link to his site:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/kento/F355.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/kento/F355.html</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Raydar||01-28-2000||04:03 PM||||Pisa also sells a front end kit that was taken from their Artero rebody. Looks GREAT on a GT. Here's the link. <A HREF="http://www.cybercars.com/mnfr/fierohq/artfe.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cybercars.com/mnfr/fierohq/artfe.htm</A>  ||||reg||1
